{"action_id":null,"arguments":[],"assumptions":[{"assumption_id":"node.8d5c968e0a897be6305f0015.a0","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The result addresses only the circular's announced Hong Kong exemption and does not determine any separate EU or UK legal requirement.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.8d5c968e0a897be6305f0015.a1","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"A transaction satisfying all listed factual conditions is treated as within the announced exemption; the result does not confer licensing, regulatory approval or legal compliance generally.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.8d5c968e0a897be6305f0015.a2","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The assessed transaction is undertaken by a corporation that is licensed by the SFC and therefore within the circular's addressed population.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.8d5c968e0a897be6305f0015.a3","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"“Non-centrally cleared single-stock options, equity basket options and equity index options” is treated as the operative product category; overseas EU and UK materials are explanatory background rather than independent Hong Kong applicability conditions.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.8d5c968e0a897be6305f0015.a4","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The announced exemption is treated as operative from 2026-01-04 even though the Code amendment is stated to be gazetted later.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.8d5c968e0a897be6305f0015.a5","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"“Until further notice” is treated as continuing unless a later SFC notice or effective amendment withdraws or changes it.","status":"PROVISIONAL"}],"bundle_hash":null,"candidate_id":"candidate.964504ba67924622b9e91ba3ca284b59","controlled_language":"[TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] The assessed transaction satisfies the factual conditions for coverage by the SFC's announced margin exemption if it is entered into by an SFC-licensed corporation, is a non-centrally cleared single-stock, equity basket or equity index option, occurs on or after 2026-01-04, and the exemption remains in force until further notice.","disposition_reason":"Unreviewed interpretation proposal","family_ids":["scope"],"generation_phase":"BLIND_INITIAL","issue_ids":[],"parent_id":null,"probability_of_legal_correctness":null,"revision_reason":"The factual condition for the Hong Kong exemption combines actor status (licensed corporation), product classification (single-stock, equity basket or equity index option), clearing status (non-centrally cleared), and time (from 2026-01-04 until further notice). EU and UK exemptions explain alignment but are not predicates in this model.","run_id":"run.4fdb750c6efe483289f180eee6e68ed2","scheduling_priority":0,"schema_version":"interpretation.v1","score_purpose":"INVESTIGATION_PRIORITY_ONLY","source_packet_hash":"b0021963635f36e84bc1dbbeb387ab5373e66c36771dd2e73cd5daccefe89655","source_unit_ids":["d802c45a4262c.u0.0","d802c45a4262c.u15.1671","d802c45a4262c.u6.1357"],"status":"ACTIVE","subject_unit":"Applicability of the SFC-announced margin exemption to a specified Hong Kong equity-options transaction"}